WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.460
Blue seats, a beige coat, a plaid scarf. The camera moves from a medium shot towards her face. Wind crosses her hair; she looks into the lens.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:13.460
A wider cabin shot: she lowers her head, rises and moves forward.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.800
She is beside the deck railing. Wind moves her hair; her hand reaches inside her coat.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.040
She looks at the photograph, her eyes still wet. Her mouth softens for a moment.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.830
A wider deck shot: she covers her face and cries, then slowly lifts her head.

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:32.000
She brings the photograph to her chest and puts it back inside her coat. She neither tears it nor throws it into the sea.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.500
She raises her chin, closes her eyes and breathes into the wind. Tears are still visible.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:47.080
The camera pulls away to reveal her, the ferry, its door and railings, and the sea.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:57.090
She leaves the ferry, crosses the terminal area and walks towards a bright entrance, her back to the camera. She does not look back.
